hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1502","We are told by Yunus bin Abdul-Ala, we are told by Abdullah bin Wahb, Amr bin Al-Harith told me, on the authority of Darraj, he told him on the authority of Abu Al-Haytham, on the authority of Abu Saeed Al-Khudri said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “If you see a man frequenting the mosque, bear witness to his faith.” He said God: The mosques of God are inhabited only by those who believe in God and the Last Day. Surat Al-Tawbah, verse 18"
